            "review_title": "Review at Sky Garden",
            "review_text": "Kim L\n1 contribution\n7\nFalse TV & Online ads about price of King Crab & Lobsters\nFeb 2018 • Family\nSky Garden BBQ falsely adv. their King Crabs & lobster. They advertise online $1 000 000 dong / 1 king crab. When you get there, the price is actually around $7 000 000 / 1 King Crab. They also mislead you about the price of their lobsters. Don't waste your time. Go elsewhere. The food is bland and not very tasty.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 2, 2018",
